# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# inside-fe — copy to .env. .env is gitignored.
#
# Read by rsbuild at BUILD time, not at run time. A change here needs a rebuild
# to reach the browser, and every value ends up in the bundle: nothing secret
# belongs in this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where the frontend sends /api calls. rsbuild.config.ts defaults it to '/api'
# when unset, which is the right answer in production — cloudflared routes /api
# to the backend on the same origin. debbie therefore carries no .env for this
# workspace at all, and does not need one.
#   local dev:  http://localhost:4061/api
#   production: unset, or /api
API_URL=http://localhost:4061/api

# CI is read by the Playwright config to decide retries and workers. The runner
# sets it. Do not set it here.
